    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not the same. \"physical presence\" sounds so hollow when nobody actually knows me in real life. it's like having a body but no soul. if the person people actually cared about is gone, then what is this? it's just a biological error at this point. i feel more like a leftover than a person. doesn't it just seem kind of pointless to keep dragging this empty version of me around?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
